Description: MediaTek MT7663 SDIO Wi-Fi driver module & Router Web UI (DKMS)
 Patched high-performance Linux driver for MediaTek MT7663 SDIO Wi-Fi,
 tuned for Linux 5.10 LTS, 6.12+ and 6.18+ with native SMP CPU affinity, udev instant IRQ mapping,
 and 802.11ac A-MSDU/Beamforming throughput boost.
